{"seq":1,"slug":"ecology-review","title":"高三生物 — 生态学综合","url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/year-3/biology/ecology-exam/ecology-review","wordCount":1938,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"高三生物-生态学综合\">高三生物 — 生态学综合</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>生态学是高考生物的最后一个大模块，涵盖种群、群落和生态系统三个层次。这部分知识点在高考中既有选择题，也有综合大题（特别是种群增长模型和生态系统的能量流动与物质循环）。高三复习需要建立从个体到种群、从种群到群落、从群落到生态系统的层级思维。</p>\n<p>生态学的三个层次：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层次</th>\n<th>研究对象</th>\n<th>核心问题</th>\n<th>高考高频考点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>种群</td>\n<td>同一时空中的同种生物</td>\n<td>种群数量如何变化？</td>\n<td>种群密度调查、增长模型</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>群落</td>\n<td>同一时空中的所有种群</td>\n<td>物种间如何相互作用？</td>\n<td>种间关系、群落演替</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>生态系统</td>\n<td>群落 + 无机环境</td>\n<td>能量如何流动？物质如何循环？</td>\n<td>食物链、能量流动、碳循环</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><h3 id=\"一-种群\">一、种群</h3><p><strong>种群的特征</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特征</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>意义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>种群密度</td>\n<td>单位面积/体积中的个体数</td>\n<td>种群最基本的数量特征</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>出生率和死亡率</td>\n<td>单位时间内新出生/死亡的个体数占总数的比例</td>\n<td>直接决定种群数量变化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>年龄结构</td>\n<td>各年龄段个体的比例</td>\n<td>预测种群数量变化趋势</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>性别比例</td>\n<td>雌雄个体的比例</td>\n<td>影响出生率</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>种群密度的调查方法</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>适用对象</th>\n<th>操作要点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>样方法</td>\n<td>植物、活动范围小的动物</td>\n<td>随机取样、统计样方内个体数、取平均值</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>标志重捕法</td>\n<td>活动范围大的动物</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>M</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow><mi>m</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N = \\frac{M \\times n}{m}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2173em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8723em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">×</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span>（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span></span>：标记总数，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span>：重捕总数，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span></span></span></span>：重捕中标记数）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>种群增长模型</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模型</th>\n<th>条件</th>\n<th>增长曲线</th>\n<th>数学描述</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>&quot;J&quot; 形增长</td>\n<td>食物充裕、无天敌、无疾病</td>\n<td>指数增长</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>N</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><msup><mi>λ</mi><mi>t</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N_t = N_0 \\lambda^t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9436em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7936em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&quot;S&quot; 形增长</td>\n<td>存在环境阻力</td>\n<td>先快后慢，趋于稳定</td>\n<td>种群数量趋向环境容纳量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span></span></span></span></span> 值（环境容纳量）</strong>：在自然条件下，种群在该环境中能维持的最大数量。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K/2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mord\">/2</span></span></span></span></span> 的意义：种群增长速率最大的时刻。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>保护濒危物种：维持种群数量在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K/2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mord\">/2</span></span></span></span></span> 以上</li>\n<li>有害生物防治：将种群数量降到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K/2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mord\">/2</span></span></span></span></span> 以下</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"二-群落\">二、群落</h3><p><strong>种间关系</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>关系类型</th>\n<th>特征</th>\n<th>实例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>竞争</td>\n<td>两种生物争夺相同资源，双方受害</td>\n<td>大小草履虫</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>捕食</td>\n<td>一方以另一方为食</td>\n<td>猞猁和雪兔</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>寄生</td>\n<td>一方受益，另一方受害</td>\n<td>蛔虫和人</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>互利共生</td>\n<td>双方互利</td>\n<td>根瘤菌和豆科植物</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>群落的结构</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>垂直结构</strong>：分层现象。植物群落的分层取决于光照（森林中乔木层→灌木层→草本层→地被层）；动物分层取决于食物和栖息条件。</li>\n<li><strong>水平结构</strong>：不同地段物种组成和密度不同，呈镶嵌分布。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>群落的演替</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>起始条件</th>\n<th>速度</th>\n<th>实例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>初生演替</td>\n<td>从没有生物的裸地开始</td>\n<td>慢（数百年）</td>\n<td>火山岩上的演替</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>次生演替</td>\n<td>从有土壤和生物残留的地方开始</td>\n<td>快（数十年）</td>\n<td>弃耕农田的演替</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"三-生态系统的结构\">三、生态系统的结构</h3><p><strong>生态系统的成分</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>成分</th>\n<th>功能</th>\n<th>实例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>非生物物质和能量</td>\n<td>提供物质和能量基础</td>\n<td>阳光、水、空气、矿物质</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>生产者</td>\n<td>固定太阳能，合成有机物</td>\n<td>绿色植物、蓝藻</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>消费者</td>\n<td>加速生态系统的物质循环</td>\n<td>动物</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分解者</td>\n<td>分解有机物为无机物</td>\n<td>细菌、真菌</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>食物链和食物网</strong>：</p>\n<p>食物链从生产者开始，不包括分解者。写法：草 → 兔 → 狐 → 鹰</p>\n<p>食物网中同一物种可能占据不同营养级。</p>\n<h3 id=\"四-生态系统的能量流动\">四、生态系统的能量流动</h3><p><strong>能量流动的特点</strong>：单向流动、逐级递减。</p>\n<p>每个营养级的能量去向：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>自身呼吸消耗</li>\n<li>流向下一营养级（被捕食）</li>\n<li>流向分解者（残枝落叶、粪便）</li>\n<li>未被利用（暂时储存在生物体内）</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>传递效率</strong>：相邻两个营养级之间的能量传递效率约为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>10</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10%</span></span></span></span></span>-<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>20</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">20\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">20%</span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>传递效率</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mtext>下一营养级同化量</mtext><mtext>本营养级同化量</mtext></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mn>100</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{传递效率} = \\frac{\\text{下一营养级同化量}}{\\text{本营养级同化量}} \\times 100\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">传递效率</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">本营养级同化量</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">下一营养级同化量</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100%</span></span></span></span></span></div><p><strong>能量金字塔</strong>：每个营养级的能量用长方形表示，底部（生产者）最大，向上依次递减。</p>\n<h3 id=\"五-生态系统的物质循环\">五、生态系统的物质循环</h3><p><strong>碳循环</strong>：</p>\n<p>碳在生物群落与无机环境之间循环：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>无机环境 → 生物群落：光合作用（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>CO</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{CO}_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CO</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> → 有机碳）</li>\n<li>生物群落 → 无机环境：呼吸作用、分解作用（有机碳 → <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>CO</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{CO}_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CO</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>）</li>\n<li>化石燃料燃烧也释放 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>CO</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{CO}_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CO</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>碳在群落内部以含碳有机物的形式沿食物链传递。</p>\n<p>温室效应的原因：大量燃烧化石燃料释放 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>CO</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{CO}_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CO</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，同时大面积森林砍伐减少了 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>CO</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{CO}_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CO</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的吸收。</p>\n<h3 id=\"六-信息传递与生态系统的稳定性\">六、信息传递与生态系统的稳定性</h3><p><strong>生态系统中的信息类型</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>传播方式</th>\n<th>实例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>物理信息</td>\n<td>光、声、温度、磁力</td>\n<td>萤火虫发光</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>化学信息</td>\n<td>化学物质</td>\n<td>性外激素、花香吸引昆虫</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>行为信息</td>\n<td>特定的行为动作</td>\n<td>蜜蜂舞蹈、孔雀开屏</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>生态系统的稳定性</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>特点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>抵抗力稳定性</td>\n<td>抵抗外界干扰维持原状的能力</td>\n<td>营养结构越复杂，抵抗力越强</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>恢复力稳定性</td>\n<td>受到破坏后恢复原状的能力</td>\n<td>通常与抵抗力稳定性负相关</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li><p>在一片草原上用标志重捕法调查某鼠种的种群密度。第一次捕获 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>100</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">100</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100</span></span></span></span></span> 只并标记后释放，一周后第二次捕获 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>80</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">80</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">80</span></span></span></span></span> 只，其中有标记的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>20</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">20</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">20</span></span></span></span></span> 只。估算该区域内该鼠种的种群数量。如果标记物容易脱落，会使估算值偏大还是偏小？</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>某生态系统中，生产者固定的能量为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1000</mn><mtext>  </mtext><mtext>kJ</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1000\\;\\text{kJ}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1000</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">kJ</span></span></span></span></span></span>。若能量传递效率为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>20</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">20\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">20%</span></span></span></span></span>，第三营养级的能量最多为多少？</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>画出一条包含 4 个营养级的食物链，并说明生产者的能量为什么不能 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>100</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">100\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100%</span></span></span></span></span> 传递到下一营养级。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>比较初生演替和次生演替：一片被火烧过的森林和一片新露出的火山岩分别属于哪种演替？为什么次生演替比初生演替快？</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><p>生态学在全球环境问题的研究中发挥着核心作用。气候变化导致的物种分布区移动、珊瑚白化、极地冰盖融化等现象，都需要用生态学的理论来分析和预测。碳循环的研究直接关系到全球碳中和目标的制定。</p>\n<p>生态系统服务价值的评估是近年来生态学研究的热点。2005 年联合国千年生态系统评估报告指出，地球上 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>60</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">60\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">60%</span></span></span></span></span> 的生态系统服务正在退化。将生态系统的&quot;隐形价值&quot;（如空气净化、水源涵养、气候调节）量化，是推动环境保护政策的科学基础。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>生态学综合的复习以三个层次（种群→群落→生态系统）为框架。种群重点掌握增长模型和 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span></span></span></span></span> 值的应用，群落重点理解种间关系和演替类型，生态系统围绕能量流动（单向流动、逐级递减、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>10</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10%</span></span></span></span></span>-<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>20</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">20\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">20%</span></span></span></span></span>）和碳循环展开。食物链的书写、能量传递效率的计算和碳循环的图解分析是高考的高频考点。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"高三生物 — 生态学综合","id":"高三生物-生态学综合"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":3,"text":"一、种群","id":"一-种群"},{"level":3,"text":"二、群落","id":"二-群落"},{"level":3,"text":"三、生态系统的结构","id":"三-生态系统的结构"},{"level":3,"text":"四、生态系统的能量流动","id":"四-生态系统的能量流动"},{"level":3,"text":"五、生态系统的物质循环","id":"五-生态系统的物质循环"},{"level":3,"text":"六、信息传递与生态系统的稳定性","id":"六-信息传递与生态系统的稳定性"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"高三生物 — 变异与进化","url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/year-3/biology/genetics-review/variation-evolution"},"next":{"title":"高三生物 — 实验设计","url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/year-3/biology/ecology-exam/experiment-design"}}